From d3c419a017d013be35f21a90be495991d778372d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Angelo Arifi <arifilabs@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 06:09:17 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] lane-300: F-141 3b: GGML_ARIFI_ADD_RMS_ROWSTABLE_N=<N> keeps
 the residual ADD -> RMS_NORM partials fusion for rows <= N (was one row only:
 a verify batch normalized every row with a different reduction order than n=1
 decode). add/multi_add already write partials by flat index/512, so row r
 owns its n=1 partials; rms_norm_partials reads row = WorkGroupID.y; admission
 keeps the one-row budget so every width fuses the same layers. Default 0 =
 unchanged. Cell 21: fused RED, unfused GREEN. Lane: lane-300

Origin: lane-300
Measured-effect: correctness only, opt-in; default 0 (served default ids == 96a6a8d976 binary, cache/determinism-x1-lane/cells/c27-10061355-state.json); 3b GREEN with the bundle; opt-in cost not measured
---
 ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/ggml-vulkan-common.h     |  2 +-
 ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/ggml-vulkan-types.h      |  2 +
 ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/ggml-vulkan.cpp          | 57 ++++++++++++++++---
 .../vulkan-shaders/rms_norm_partials.comp     | 16 +++---
 4 files changed, 60 insertions(+), 17 deletions(-)

